{"id":"vod_hh_118784","vodId":"118784","provider":"hh","providerName":"豪华资源","type":2,"name":"剑风传奇","name_cn":"剑风传奇","date":"1997-01-01","year":"1997","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日本动漫","remarks":"第25集完结","images":{"common":"https://hhmage.com/cover/7a40d4e3856232074fe0920c28f779ad.jpg"},"summary":"未来的某一天，人类世界堕落成充满血光、杀戮与贪婪的饿鬼道和修罗场，百年战争将所有的人间乐土摧毁殆尽，放眼望去满地饿殍，尸横遍野。少年格斯拥有极为悲惨的命运，他在乱世之中成长为一名只知道依靠手中的兵器存活的佣兵，直到他遇到了宿命中的使者——统率着实力强大的佣兵集团“鹰之团”的格里菲斯。这个有着英俊面庞和超强战斗力的男子带领他的伙伴一步步爬上世界的顶端，而格斯也从心底臣服在格里菲斯的麾下。乱世之中，他们为了各自的理想拼搏，甚至不惜将灵魂献给魔鬼。这正是人性的悲剧……","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2026-01-19 19:24:02","playable":true,"episodeCount":25,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"hhm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/epYYyo2a/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/aM883X3e/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/dwppJxwe/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/eVOO3W1a/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/bDkk3xna/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/b2kkKrvd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/eXDD8XWe/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/elYYrEra/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/dG663X7b/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/dyPPLA7b/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/ejRRpgRe/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/b688OVne/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/erkkA7Ea/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/e0RRGovb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/aQWW9Lld/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第16集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/en55wlRd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第17集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/dwppJxRe/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第18集","url":"https://play.hhuus.c